{"route":"/news-highlights/1098-pt-round-01,-2023-in-assay-by-hplc-in-tablet-formulation","kind":"news","crumbs":[{"label":"News & Highlights","href":"/news-highlights"},{"label":"PT round 01, 2023 in Assay by HPLC in tablet formulation."}],"updated":"2023-02-28","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/news-highlights.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/news-highlights/1098-pt-round-01,-2023-in-assay-by-hplc-in-tablet-formulation.html","title":"PT round 01, 2023 in Assay by HPLC in tablet formulation.","bodyHtml":"<h5>IPC is going to conduct PT round 01, 2023 in<strong> Assay by HPLC in tablet formulatio</strong><strong>n</strong><strong>. </strong>You are requested to find the attached registration form and send your consent with filled registration form on e-mail at <a href=\"mailto:qualityassurance-ipc@gov.in\">qualityassurance-ipc@gov.in</a> on or before 10th March 2023.</h5>\n\n<p><strong><a href=\"/news-highlights/1035-application-are-invited-for-the-23rd-skill-development-programme-on-pharmacovigilance-for-medical-products\" data-internal></a> <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Intimation_Letter_PT-012023.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Intimation Letter PT-01,2023<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/news-highlights/1035-application-are-invited-for-the-23rd-skill-development-programme-on-pharmacovigilance-for-medical-products\" data-internal></a> <a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Registration_Form_PT-01.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Registration Form PT-01<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></strong></p>","date":"2023-02-24","category":"Announcements"}